gz8(){return"We'll build a personalized daily plan that takes you from your current distance to running 10 kilometers straight \u2014 gradual mileage increases, with rest days built in."},
gze(){return"Cardiovascular endurance and leg strength \u2014 running trains your whole aerobic system, not just one muscle group."},
gz2(){return"Running is one of the most accessible ways to build cardiovascular health \u2014 no equipment beyond a pair of shoes, and it's directly tied to long-term heart and metabolic health."},
