gzv(){return"Uses your phone's proximity sensor. Place it face-up on the floor, right where your face or chest lowers to during the push up. Getting close enough and pulling back again counts as one rep."},
gzy(){return"Uses your phone's accelerometer. Keep it in your front pants or shorts pocket while you squat. Going down and back up counts as one rep."},
