gzt(){return"Uses your phone's accelerometer. Place it screen-up on your lower back, or in a snug back pocket. The timer only runs while your torso is horizontal: if you stand up or drop to your knees, it stops until you're back in position. It detects the position, not your form \u2014 lying flat on the floor looks the same."},
